  "notes": "COMMON PATTERNS:\n- {思考|しこう}する (to think, to reason)\n- {思考|しこう}{力|りょく} (thinking ability)\n- {思考|しこう}{回路|かいろ} (thought process, way of thinking)\n- {論理的|ろんりてき}{思考|しこう} (logical thinking)\n- プラス{思考|しこう} (positive thinking)\n- マイナス{思考|しこう} (negative thinking)\n- {思考|しこう}{停止|ていし} (cessation of thinking)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {思考|しこう} vs. {考|かんが}え\n  - {思考|しこう}: formal, often used for systematic thinking\n  - {考|かんが}え: general, everyday word for thoughts or ideas",
